WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:03.110
<i>Koikawa-dono! Hibachi-dono!</i>

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:04.230
<i>Where's the bug?</i>

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:41.830
<b>Kakeashi Kamikiri: Charging Mantis</b>

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:45.580
I will be the one to finish it,

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:48.130
so you get out of here.

00:01:48.130 --> 00:01:49.090
What was that?

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:50.880
You're just good for blowing stuff up!

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:53.560
And you can't do anything but drink!

00:02:01.380 --> 00:02:03.430
Oh, no! People are evacuating that way!

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:18.280
Matsukichi! Tamekichi!

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:21.070
Do my bidding!

00:02:28.780 --> 00:02:31.500
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:39.680
He knocked over that big bug 
with one strike!

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:40.760
Wow!

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:45.890
Ichinotani-dono's shikigami are very powerful!

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:48.770
I'll do my part, too!

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:50.980
Always be ready for a fight!

00:02:57.010 --> 00:02:58.770
You're amazing!

00:02:58.770 --> 00:03:00.280
You're so cool!

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:02.620
Thank you!

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:12.080
Mister! Mister!

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:16.650
That was quite impressive, Tenma-kun.

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:18.560
Not bad.

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:21.140
You're pretty good.

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:23.090
Not really.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:28.260
You guys are just lame.

00:03:30.500 --> 00:03:34.160
I'm trying to give you a compliment here!

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:35.770
What's his problem?

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:38.630
He shouldn't talk to me that way...

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:41.820
C-Calm down, please, you two...

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:44.800
I'm sure Ichinotani-dono knows what he's doing—

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:47.120
Shut up!

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:52.030
Tenma-kun hasn't changed a bit.

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:57.380
<b>Ichinotani Tenma! 
I Can Do It!</b>

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:02.880
One, two...

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:06.290
One, two...

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:06.890
One...

00:04:07.490 --> 00:04:08.890
Okay, done!

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:12.180
You're so cute...

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:15.150
Maybe I'll call it a Balsam Bomb.

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:22.900
Thank you for the food.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:32.960
Mother, Father, watch over me.

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:37.330
I shall do my job tomorrow, as well.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:48.600
We did great today, right?

00:04:49.110 --> 00:04:51.350
We hit that bug really hard!

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:01.950
But actually, I was a little afraid...

00:05:03.140 --> 00:05:05.250
No, never mind!

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:06.660
I can do it!

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:10.610
Maybe I'll go to sleep.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:26.340
Ichinotani-dono, what's wrong?

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:29.350
Nothing.

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:33.400
But I heard this huge scream...

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:35.100
It was nothing.

00:05:36.470 --> 00:05:38.590
Really?

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:43.820
Was it that?

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:47.820
This, then?

00:05:49.480 --> 00:05:50.320
Then...

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:57.270
I assume it isn't that...

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:16.580
What?

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:17.940
You're really afraid of bugs?

00:06:19.180 --> 00:06:21.250
Especially crawly ones?

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:24.440
They're the worst?

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:26.610
Like this?

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.450
Wh-When I was little...

00:06:56.810 --> 00:07:00.060
But shouldn't you tell the others?

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:03.480
This is important and could affect your work.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:05.260
No!

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:07.900
I c-can't let anyone know my weakness!

00:07:07.900 --> 00:07:10.740
I must be able to do everything myself.

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:15.830
I... I have to be a real onmyoji.

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:20.240
So my mom and dad will be happy.

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:24.020
<b>Loyalty</b>

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:26.730
What loyalty!

00:07:26.730 --> 00:07:28.260
What devotion!

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:34.090
I, Tsukishima Jinbei, am much moved.

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:37.610
Then, will you keep it a secret?

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:41.660
If Hibachi-dono and Koikawa find out, 
I'll never live it down.

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:42.650
Of course.

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:46.190
It's a promise between men, Ichinotani-dono.

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:52.010
Call me Tenma.

00:07:52.010 --> 00:07:52.660
What?

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:55.180
Call me Tenma.

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:58.060
Ichinotani is a long name, 
and it's a pain to say.

00:07:58.060 --> 00:08:00.090
And so...

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:02.080
Sure thing, Tenma-dono!

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:04.080
Tenma-dono...

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:05.490
Tenma-dono!

00:08:05.770 --> 00:08:07.270
Tenma-dono, huh?

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:08.180
Enough.

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:09.950
Stop repeating it.

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:11.920
Sure thing, Tenma-dono!

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:13.400
I just told you...

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:22.690
Good morning, Tenma-dono.

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:26.190
What are you doing here so early?

00:08:26.570 --> 00:08:27.830
Please excuse me.

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:32.150
Tenma-dono, let's train!

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:37.410
The only way to make your wish come true

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:40.250
is by overcoming your fear of bugs.

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:43.710
I, Tsukishima Jinbei, will help you.

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:47.920
I really don't need to train...

00:08:47.920 --> 00:08:50.270
Now, then! Go get ready.

00:08:50.270 --> 00:08:51.050
Come...

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:52.620
Come!

00:08:54.390 --> 00:08:56.470
I don't want to do this.

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:58.040
Everyone will find out!

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:00.160
It's okay.

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.850
We're behind the storehouse.

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:03.870
No one will come this way.

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:05.920
Here I go, Tenma-dono.

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:12.110
I'm f-fine with something small like that.

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:13.790
Splendid.

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:14.880
Okay, next!

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:18.360
I'm f-fine.

00:09:18.360 --> 00:09:20.330
If I squint, I can barely see it.

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:25.150
At this rate, you'll be over it in no time.

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:28.720
I'm fi—

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:29.890
Fi...

00:09:32.470 --> 00:09:33.590
No! No! No!

00:09:35.280 --> 00:09:37.720
I guess the crawling ones are tough.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:39.350
Good morning!

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:42.810
What are you doing here so early?

00:09:43.120 --> 00:09:46.670
W-Walking... And training.

00:09:46.670 --> 00:09:48.350
We're circling a hundred times.

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:51.700
Good to hear it, you two.

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:53.440
Oh, right.

00:09:54.890 --> 00:09:56.950
I brought you something to eat.

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:59.370
Here you go.

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:01.660
Thank you.

00:10:10.980 --> 00:10:12.360
T-Tenma-dono!

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:15.600
Enjoy your snack!

00:10:15.600 --> 00:10:18.720
I just happened to find those.

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:23.050
I trusted you... And you told them!

00:10:23.880 --> 00:10:25.980
You traitor!

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:29.210
Tenma-dono!

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:32.230
All right!

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:33.940
You two...

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:36.490
That wasn't deliberate, was it?

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:39.610
How horrible!

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:40.980
What?

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:43.600
You'll tell me what I can 
and can't do, Tsukishima?

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:48.670
For the sake of his beloved parents,

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:53.130
Tenma-dono was trying to 
overcome his weakness!

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:56.360
For you to mock that...

00:10:56.360 --> 00:10:59.380
As samurai, you should be ashamed!

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:00.990
Tenma-dono!

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:05.270
We aren't actually samurai...

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:06.960
Right?

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:07.800
Yeah.

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:09.390
Man, what's his problem?

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:25.660
Didn't I do well, Dad?

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:28.460
Keep it up, for our family's sake.

00:11:31.890 --> 00:11:34.760
<i>I have to be able to do this.</i>

00:11:39.530 --> 00:11:41.220
Onmyoji-oniisan!

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:45.740
Those big paper dolls yesterday were really cool.

00:11:46.650 --> 00:11:49.040
He says he wants to be like you,

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:54.230
so he's begun attending school to learn to write!

00:11:56.010 --> 00:11:56.990
Thank you.

00:11:57.650 --> 00:11:58.840
Look!

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:04.630
Matsukichi and Tamekichi...

00:12:04.630 --> 00:12:08.130
I just started, and I can't write the characters yet.

00:12:08.130 --> 00:12:09.580
So I drew a picture.

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:21.460
Jinbei-sama!

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:23.500
There's trouble!

00:12:23.500 --> 00:12:25.160
What's wrong, Oharu-dono?

00:12:26.270 --> 00:12:27.220
More bugs!

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.370
What?

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:29.720
Are there really...

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:31.330
more bugs?

00:12:31.330 --> 00:12:32.340
Yeah...

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:36.550
Go get them!

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:39.110
Let's go, Tenma-dono!

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:50.360
Do you think he'll come?

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:51.430
No idea.

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:53.870
But maybe not,

00:12:54.470 --> 00:12:55.870
considering what we're facing.

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:00.970
Koikawa-dono! Hibachi-dono!

00:13:02.290 --> 00:13:03.510
Where's the bug?

00:13:22.940 --> 00:13:26.740
<b>Senzoku Mukade - Thousand-Legged Centipede</b>

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:30.770
This one might be a bit much for you, kid.

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:33.260
You can just stay back.

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:37.440
Tenma-dono, don't force yourself!

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:50.720
<i>What...</i>

00:13:54.610 --> 00:13:56.710
<i>What can I do?</i>

00:13:58.170 --> 00:13:59.190
<i>Hydrangea Blossoms!</i>

00:14:05.190 --> 00:14:06.740
Matsukichi! Tamekichi!

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:08.830
Do my bidding!

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:12.170
<i>Full Speed Ahead!</i>

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:19.000
Watch out!

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:20.980
Hey, keep out of our way!

00:14:23.150 --> 00:14:26.690
Kid, if you can't do it, don't push it!

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:27.750
You, too, Tsukishima!

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:29.940
Don't jump at every chance to attack!

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:31.770
I'm s-sorry...

00:14:31.770 --> 00:14:34.820
But that's all I can do.

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:40.000
<i>I... I have to be able to do this!</i>

00:14:43.510 --> 00:14:45.760
Jinbei-sama, you can do it!

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:49.540
Oharu-dono!

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:58.620
This isn't the time!

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:10.570
<i>Matsukichi... Tamekichi...</i>

00:15:11.860 --> 00:15:15.930
<i>Those big paper dolls yesterday
 were really cool.</i>

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:23.770
We can't do anything while it's underground!

00:15:24.260 --> 00:15:26.180
We need to pin it down.

00:15:26.180 --> 00:15:27.050
I can do it.

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:30.570
I c-can use Matsukichi and Tamekichi

00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:33.360
to hit it in the stomach.

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:37.390
Once it's in the air, it should be helpless.

00:15:37.770 --> 00:15:39.330
But aren't you...

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:40.540
Understood!

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:44.770
Everyone has things they're afraid of.

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:47.880
What matters is whether you 
can overcome that fear.

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:52.760
Let's show that bug
 that you aren't going

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:54.430
to let it beat you!

00:15:55.110 --> 00:15:58.140
I won't let that kid have all the fun.

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:01.640
Take as long as you need.

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:20.870
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:16:22.670 --> 00:16:23.790
Close!

00:16:24.570 --> 00:16:27.040
It's no use... 
I have to get closer.

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:32.050
<i>What... What can I do?</i>

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:39.810
<i>Once more!</i>

00:16:39.810 --> 00:16:41.810
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:45.560
Just a little more!

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:47.730
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:48.540
<i>More...</i>

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:49.650
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:50.880
<i>Get closer...</i>

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:57.830
<i>Full-Power Slap! Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:56.360
Do everything you can to overcome your fear!

00:16:58.560 --> 00:17:00.620
Shut up, traitor!

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:05.710
Traitor?

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:11.050
Sorry, we were actually eavesdropping.

00:17:12.570 --> 00:17:15.880
We heard you were scared of bugs, 
and we couldn't help ourselves...

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:17.850
Sorry...

00:17:18.610 --> 00:17:21.900
<i>Then Tsukishima didn't tell you...</i>

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:29.230
Onii-san!

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:35.280
You can beat that bug!

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:42.250
Come on, Tenma-dono!

00:17:42.250 --> 00:17:44.040
Time for you to do your job!

00:17:44.720 --> 00:17:45.650
Here I go!

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:49.110
Matsukichi! Tamekichi!

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:50.590
Do my bidding!

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:12.070
You won't escape...

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:17.030
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:18:18.260 --> 00:18:21.010
Go!

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:28.420
All right!

00:18:28.740 --> 00:18:29.960
This is it!

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:33.340
Always be ready for a fight!

00:18:33.340 --> 00:18:34.710
<i>Repentance Slash!</i>

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:37.090
<i>Secret Technique: Thousand Bladed Flowers!</i>

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:52.070
You did it, Tenma-dono!

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:55.570
You really are the best onmyoji in Japan!

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:56.790
Not bad.

00:18:57.880 --> 00:18:59.790
You're pretty impressive.

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:02.130
Onii-san!

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:12.550
<i>Father, Mother...</i>

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:14.800
<i>I did it!</i>

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:30.440
I'm sorry.

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:35.110
The spies we sent to Kyoto

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:37.610
were wiped out again.

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:44.450
But Edo is still perfectly safe.

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:47.770
We have Mugai here.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:56.280
We shall protect the city,

00:19:56.280 --> 00:19:59.880
and you, as well.

00:20:10.490 --> 00:20:11.690
Ichinotani Tenma...

00:20:12.880 --> 00:20:14.600
can now do it!

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:16.940
Um...

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:21.350
Look how close I can get!

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:25.990
That's great, Tenma-dono!

00:20:27.350 --> 00:20:28.850
Then you're okay now.

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:29.830
Glad to hear it.

00:20:30.090 --> 00:20:32.050
What a rapid change.

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:35.300
Huh, there's another one?

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:44.740
<i>Full-Power Slap!</i>

00:20:44.740 --> 00:20:45.360
Huh?!

00:20:49.700 --> 00:20:53.600
<b>He can't do it after all.</b>

00:20:58.220 --> 00:21:00.210
We've received word from 
Mizuno-sama's mansion,

00:21:00.210 --> 00:21:02.110
requesting an extermination.

00:21:02.990 --> 00:21:07.250
You and Mugai-kun will be going.

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:12.620
Mugai-kun chose you specifically from the group.

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:18.880
<i>What?</i>

00:21:19.610 --> 00:21:23.380
<i>Mugai-dono chose me?</i>

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:28.840
Wh-Wh-What?!

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:03.230
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:00.150 --> 00:23:02.230
Mugai-dono picked me!

00:23:02.230 --> 00:23:03.230
Congratulations.

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:06.650
Someday, I'll take that shining star for my own.

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:08.030
Big, shining star...

00:23:08.030 --> 00:23:08.730
Grab!

00:23:08.730 --> 00:23:10.200
That isn't a star!

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:11.830
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:11.260 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>Mugai: What Solitary Eyes See</b>

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:14.000
Mugai: What Solitary Eyes See.
